            "notes": "**Items:** For Round 2, we are going to utilise the [Donut Delivery](item_296adb69-d517-4885-903a-ef8f3a1d6a7b) item as this drastically increases the power and efficiency of using TP by healing all of our teammates near us. This item is **essential** to this build, so you might need to sell the green items if you cannot afford it. You should have at least 10,000 Stadium Cash after the first round.  \n\nYou can keep the three green items from the first round if you can afford it, if not you can just keep the ones that you feel the most benefit from. For me, I keep [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) and  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) - in the rare case that I cannot afford all of these.\n_____\n**Round Notes:** This is the round where TP becomes very strong as the healing is buffed by [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) upgrades so you should be TPing as much as you can, whilst also playing safe.",
