            "notes": "**Power:** You are going to want to get [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68) as this allows you to farm Ultimate Charge with your Suzu. This is very strong against rebuffs from characters such as [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54), [Ana](hero_f1aee6cf-704f-455f-a100-ec882ebbe000) and [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1), as well as any abilities that the enemy team may have that cause damage over time. \n_____\n**Items:** We are going to want [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) as this gives us a Damage over Time effect. This effect is technically a negative effect and counts towards the bonus ultimate charge from [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68). This allows you to get free Ultimate Charge everytime you cleanse yourself which is common if you and your team are playing close. It is also even better if your teammates also purchase this it counts it on teammates as a negative effect too.\n_____\n**Round Notes:** There are a few blue items you can swap the green items for if you can afford them. This is very possible with this build.",
